<robot name="opentrons_flex_8channel_photo_reference">
  <!--
Visual assembly derived from user-supplied flex-model.glb, SHA256 b3280f704c6f28663ba9252d310747a512ca6a8e8504e33dd16676b0b15078fe.
Source GLB identifies a FLEX TOP LEVEL ASSEMBLY WITH STAGING SLOT SAMPLE.STEP conversion.
Original author/license not supplied; this is not a claim of manufacturer-certified CAD.
Converted glTF Y-up to URDF Z-up, retaining source scale and neutral component positions.
Geometry split into fixed chassis, windows, folding door, gantry and carriage.
The missing lower-right window mirrors the supplied lower-left window.
Complete deck surround, twelve recessed working inserts, four staging pads, clear locators, blue clips,
coordinate markings and 8-channel pipette exterior are photo-informed reconstructions guided by IMG_6746-6752.
The incomplete source deck fixtures were removed to avoid overlapping or duplicate surfaces.
Deck pitch 164 x 107 mm: https://github.com/Opentrons/opentrons/blob/edge/shared-data/deck/definitions/3/ot3_standard.json
Envelope approximately 872.85 x 690.96 x 839.90 mm; source CAD tessellation retained.
Joint travel, hinge axes, collision boxes and pipette dimensions are approximations, not calibration data.
Mass distribution is unknown: dynamics omitted, effort/velocity zero disables uncalibrated actuation.
Revised 2026-10-24. Previous ChemLab visual geometry is replaced, not relabeled as manufacturer CAD.
-->
